Source kept for reading. Nothing here builds.

`web/dev-server/deps.js` skips a directory holding this file, and everything under it.
`enclosure_assembly.py` is not a generator: `build-all` does not run it, the watcher does
not rebuild it, `build:check` does not compare its outputs, and `enclosure-assembly.step`
has no producer. The `.step`, the three elevations and the scorecard sidecar beside them
are what the last live build left.

What this tree places is 40-odd bodies, the datum each stands off, the port stations they
mate on, and the runs `_lines.py` authors between them. The appliance is assembled a body
at a time in `hardware/manifold-layout/front_half.py`.

`enclosure.py`, `front_half.py`, `manifold_layout.py`, `arrange.py` and `probe.py` put this
directory on `sys.path` and import the bodies and constants it names. An edit in here
rebuilds none of them.

`last-stable-enclosure` is the last state this tree built in. `front-half-attempt/` beside
this file is a reverted rewrite of the pack around front-half.
